  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Read the command path left to right",
      "items": [
        "Widgets emit intents; they do not execute game behavior.",
        "CommandController builds a domain Command; RoomCommandProcessor owns execution policy.",
        "Lua dispatch order is inventory, hotspot, then game fallback."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Why RoomScene feels huge",
      "items": [
        "It owns the session and implements host seams for input, commands, scripting, persistence, and presentation.",
        "The extracted collaborators are real boundaries, but lifecycle wiring and many Lua façades remain centralized."
      ]
    }
  ]
